NONA
Nope.  Do you want more coffee.

MIKA
Please ... yes.

NONA
Oh, it is two by the way.

MIKA
Two what.

NONA
Two bathrooms with pink tile.  The other is lime green.

EXT. OF TAN BRICK HOUSE

MIKA is outside a plain looking house built in the early 1970s.  

NONA is outside as well looking at front gardern.

